# Skulduggery: -1/-1 on Bot2's Memnite leaves it 0/0, so it dies as state-based actions are checked (CR 704.5f), while Bot1's
# own Memnite gets +1/+1 for the turn (CR 611.2a). Cast on Bot2's turn (it is an instant, CR 304.1): Bot2's Memnite is in the
# graveyard and Bot1's, a 2/2 until the end of that turn, is a 1/1 again on turn 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Memnite
Mox Jet
Skulduggery
Swamp x4
Swamp x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x21

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Skulduggery.Cast
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
? Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 2
[T3 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Toughness = 1
Bot1.Graveyard = Skulduggery
